## API kit (Signet)

This application was scaffolded with the **API** starter kit — token-first JSON
polarity, no session dashboard.

- Issue a personal access token: `POST /api/tokens` with `email`, `password`, and
  `device_name` (optional `abilities`)
- Revoke the current token: `DELETE /api/tokens/current` (Bearer required)
- Revoke a named token: `DELETE /api/tokens/{id}`
- Authenticated user: `GET /api/user` under the `auth:signet` guard
- CSRF cookie for first-party SPAs: `GET /signet/csrf-cookie` (framework route)

Use the returned `token` as `Authorization: Bearer {id}|{secret}`. Signet is
booted by the foundation; no extra provider is required.
